{"t":"ABT","n":"Abbott Laboratories","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":103.32,"chg":0.32,"chgPct":0.00311,"prev":103.0,"dayH":103.89,"dayL":102.37,"w52H":129.85,"w52L":81.97,"vol":6957371,"avgVol":7747590,"mcap":178944212992,"pe":38.55,"fpe":17.42,"eps":2.68,"feps":5.93,"pb":3.51,"div":2.52,"divY":0.0244,"beta":0.54,"short":19058208,"shortPct":0.0123,"shortRatio":1.95,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Medical Devices","iKo":"의료기기","city":"Abbott Park","emp":122000,"web":"https://www.abbott.com","sum":"Abbott Laboratories, together with its subsidiaries, discovers, develops, manufactures, and sells health care products worldwide. It operates in four segments: Established Pharmaceutical Products, Diagnostic Products, Nutritional Products, and Medical Devices. The company offers generic pharmaceuticals for the treatment of pancreatic exocrine insufficiency, irritable bowel syndrome or biliary spasm, intrahepatic cholestasis or depressive symptoms, gynecological disorder, hormone replacement therapy, dyslipidemia, hypertension, hypothyroidism, hypertriglyceridemia, Ménière's disease and vestibular vertigo, pain, fever, inflammation, and migraine, as well as provides anti-infective clarithromycin, influenza vaccine, and products to regulate physiological rhythm of the colon. It also provides","sumKo":"Abbott Laboratories는 자회사와 함께 전 세계적으로 건강 관리 제품을 발견, 개발, 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 확립된 의약품, 진단 제품, 영양 제품, 의료 기기 등 4개 부문으로 운영됩니다. 회사는 췌장 외분비 부전, 과민성 대장 증후군 또는 담도 경련, 간내 담즙 정체 또는 우울 증상, 부인과 질환, 호르몬 대체 요법, 이상지질혈증, 고혈압, 갑상선 기능 저하증, 고중성지방혈증, 메니에르병 및 전정 현기증, 통증, 발열, 염증 및 편두통 치료를 위한 제네릭 의약품을 제공하고 항감염제도 제공합니다. 클라리스로마이신, 인플루엔자 백신, 대장의 생리적 리듬을 조절하는 제품. 그것은 또한 제공합니다"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":43653000000,"ni":6933000000},{"y":2023,"rev":40109000000,"ni":5723000000},{"y":2024,"rev":41950000000,"ni":13402000000},{"y":2025,"rev":44328000000,"ni":6524000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":11459000000,"ni":1776000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":11164000000,"ni"